SUMMARY:Garden Stratford Plant Sale 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Garden Stratford’s annual Plant Sale!\n\nThe sale runs rain or shine as it is indoors. You will find a large selection of Member-donated perennials\, herbs\, seedlings\, and native plants from sun to shade. All plants are pay-what-you-wish; however\, prices are suggested by plant size.\n\nThe Tri-County Master Gardeners will be on hand to answer questions and offer gardening advice!\n\nCash or Cheque ONLY.\n\nBring a basket\, bag\, or tray to carry your plants.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/garden-stratford-plant-sale-2026/
LOCATION:The Local CFC\, 612 Erie St.\, Stratford\, N5A 2P1
CATEGORIES:Plant Sale
