SUMMARY:District 2 2026 Flower Show
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 District 2 Flower Show is being held on June 13\, 2026\, at the Richcraft Rec Centre in Kanata. The space is being sponsored by City of Ottawa Councillor\, Cathy Curry.\nThe Theme for the Flower Show will be “The World Cup of Soccer Comes to Canada”.\nTo participate in what promises to be a great community event\, please contact the Show Chair\, Gay MacQuarrie by email at gardens.gay(at)outlook.com \nPre-registration for the Design Classes is needed by May 31\, 2026. For more info contact Linda Bartlett by email at lmbartlett62 (at) gmail.com \nHere is a link to the Flower Show Schedule. \n 
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/district-2-2026-flower-show/
LOCATION:Richcraft Recreation Centre\, 4101 Innovation Drive\, Kanata\, ON\, K2K 0J3
CATEGORIES:Calling All Volunteers,District,Flower & Vegetable Show
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/hort-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
